<title>UK: Farm Credit Corp sets C$100 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Farm Credit Corp sets C$100 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FARM CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    06.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.35    PAY DATE    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.725    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LOND	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT CAN TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
